      {
        "id": 198560,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-27T18:06:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;Baron Blade's episode is my favorite so far. &nbsp;A lot of background and a story that goes from being the main villain to at least becoming a hero in the end. &nbsp;The hero part was temporary but still a neat transition along with the questions from heroes about why he has these Doomsday devices. &nbsp;I'm more curious about his role in the RPG as wwell because of this. &nbsp;It also had one of the&nbsp;<span>biggest reveals to me in that </span><span>he founded RevoCorp which up to that point we had no idea on any of their background.&nbsp;</span></p><p>2. &nbsp;The Setback episode is my least favorite. &nbsp;I feel there was a lot of more story to tell of his conflicts with RevoCorp between Plague Rat and Revenant that the questions didn't get into at all. &nbsp;</p><p>3 &amp; 4. I don't have a most or least favorite Interlude episode. &nbsp;They've all had something to pique my interest.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:26:30.475Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
