        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-27T20:27:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wanna say my favorite so far has been Nightmist, or maybe Gloomweaver. Getting into the magical side of the Multiverse, there was a whole lot more to be learned than I anticipated. Least favorite is probably the Freedom Five; even Christopher and Adam admitted they'd already gone over most of the story elements in previous episodes. At least there's always good questions! Interludes I don't recall as well. :B</p>",
